TAC GIA

Toan bo ma nguon nay do AI viet: Claude (Anthropic), chay trong Claude Code.
Khong phai mot phan, khong phai "co AI ho tro" - la TOAN BO: thiet ke, doc
nguoc server.dll/engine.dll, viet ma, do dac, va moi ghi chu trong kho nay.

Nguoi van hanh may chu that da dat bai toan, chay thu, chup log, phat hien loi,
va bac bo nhieu ket luan sai. Cac dong ghi "SAI, da sua" trong ma nguon chinh la
dau vet cua nhung lan bi bac bo do.


